who lived here.


00:12:15.351 --> 00:12:16.937
That was a long time ago.


00:12:17.041 --> 00:12:19.489
It doesn't matter though.
Not really.


00:12:19.593 --> 00:12:20.524
What do you want?


00:12:20.662 --> 00:12:22.696
You have to do things.


00:12:23.731 --> 00:12:25.179
