the police now, okay?


00:12:37.834 --> 00:12:39.075
You can't do that.
I will.


00:12:39.144 --> 00:12:40.144
I wouldn't.


00:12:40.834 --> 00:12:42.937
Don't tell anyone.


00:12:43.041 --> 00:12:45.075
I wouldn't tell
anyone at all.


00:12:45.179 --> 00:12:46.593
Don't you dare.


00:12:48.006 --> 00:12:49.524
Get up.


00:12:49.627 --> 00:12:51.213
You need to leave.
This is not okay.


00:12:51.351 --> 00:12:53.006
