That's the first thing
that I would've said.


00:15:14.558 --> 00:15:17.213
That's the first thing
that people say. "Oh, my God, it's a bomb." No.


00:15:18.524 --> 00:15:22.041
It was just
an old wooden box.


00:15:23.317 --> 00:15:26.075
She left it on the road.
It's just sitting here.


00:15:27.455 --> 00:15:32.179
<i>Well, she was</i>
<i>probably just senile.</i> Maybe.


00:15:32.282 --> 00:15:36.179
<i>You said she was old.</i>
<i>Maybe she was confused,</i> <i>off her meds?</i>


00:15:40.317 --> 00:15:41.972
I don't know what she was.


00:15:42.075 --> 00:15:44.696
<i>But she's gone now?</i>
Yeah.


00:15:45.627 --> 00:15:46.558
Yeah.


00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.731
<i>I'm sure you're okay,</i>
<i>Baby Doll.</i>


00:15:49.868 --> 00:15:51.834
<i>If not, go over to Mrs. Trott.</i>


00:15:51.903 --> 00:15:53.420
Well, she's still
out of town.


00:15:53.558 --> 00:15:57.627
<i>I feel like that woman</i>
<i>never sits still</i> <i>since her husband died.</i>


00:15:57.731 --> 00:15:59.868
