<i>Polly. You gotta focus.</i>


00:16:25.937 --> 00:16:27.144
<i>This is a big deal, sweetie.</i>


00:16:27.248 --> 00:16:28.593
<i>And Lainie called--</i>
Yeah, I know.


00:16:28.696 --> 00:16:30.248
That's why I got off
of work early,


00:16:30.317 --> 00:16:31.662
and I was planning
on doing that right now.


00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.593
And I know
what Lainie fuckin' did. <i>Okay, okay.</i>


00:16:33.662 --> 00:16:35.903
<i>Honey, it's gonna be okay.</i>
<i>I'm</i>32 years old.


00:16:35.972 --> 00:16:37.455
I've had
job interviews before,


00:16:37.558 --> 00:16:38.937
and I'm just thinking
about going back to school.


00:16:39.041 --> 00:16:41.179
I don't even know
if that's what I want. <i>I know. I know.</i>


00:16:41.282 --> 00:16:43.593
<i>But we have</i>
<i>to start somewhere.</i>


00:16:43.731 --> 00:16:45.282
<i>I've been praying on it,</i>
<i>you know?</i>


00:16:45.386 --> 00:16:48.834
Yeah, I was
being a bitch. Sorry.


00:16:48.972 --> 00:16:52.524
<i>No. I just don't</i>
<i>want you distracted,</i> <i>that's all.</i>


00:16:52.627 --> 00:16:55.593
Okay... [SIGHS] let me
call you back in a bit.


00:16:55.662 --> 00:16:59.179
I'm gonna try on some outfits.
I'll send you some pictures.


00:16:59.282 --> 00:17:02.317
Are you gonna
be up for a while? <i>I'll be up, Baby Doll.</i>


00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.110
Okay. Love you. Bye.


