01:02:24.972 --> 01:02:28.558
You killed them.
<i>No. You did.</i>


01:02:28.662 --> 01:02:30.903
<i>Bad girl. Bad.</i>


01:02:31.731 --> 01:02:32.937
I made a mistake!


01:02:33.041 --> 01:02:36.489
<i>There are no mistakes!</i>
<i>Only choices.</i>


01:02:36.593 --> 01:02:38.351
<i>Right and wrong.</i>


01:02:38.489 --> 01:02:42.110
<i>You saw what you wanted.</i>
<i>You gave what</i> <i>you wanted to give.</i>


01:02:42.179 --> 01:02:45.248
<i>But did you truly</i>
<i>need it, Auntie P?</i>


01:02:45.351 --> 01:02:48.662
<i>Or did you truly need</i>
<i>to give something easy?</i>


01:02:48.765 --> 01:02:50.179
It wasn't easy...


01:02:50.282 --> 01:02:52.937
<i>You must suffer</i>
<i>not to suffer.</i>


01:02:54.317 --> 01:02:56.662
<i>Are you ready to play more?</i>


01:02:57.282 --> 01:02:58.972
<i>What do you love?</i>


01:03:00.110 --> 01:03:02.593
<i>What do you love?</i>
I loved them.


01:03:04.558 --> 01:03:05.800
<i>Did you?</i>


01:03:06.937 --> 01:03:10.248
<i>Think hard. Real hard.</i>


01:03:10.972 --> 01:03:12.455
I loved you!


01:03:21.006 --> 01:03:22.558
<i>I wanna play.</i>


01:03:22.662 --> 01:03:24.317
<i>Can we play?</i>


01:03:26.972 --> 01:03:31.213
<i>Read me a story. Please.</i>


01:03:33.179 --> 01:03:36.627
<i>This little piggy</i>
<i>went to market.</i>


01:03:36.731 --> 01:03:39.558
<i>This little piggy stayed home.</i>


01:03:39.662 --> 01:03:43.351
<i>This little piggy</i>
<i>had roast beef.</i>


01:03:43.420 --> 01:03:46.627
<i>This little piggy had none.</i>


01:03:46.731 --> 01:03:52.627
<i>And this little piggy</i>
<i>went "wee wee wee"</i>


01:03:52.731 --> 01:03:57.041
[POLLY BREATHING SHAKILY]
<i>all the way home.</i>


01:03:57.386 --> 01:03:58.972
You're dead.


01:03:59.075 --> 01:04:04.489
<i>No. I'm right here.</i>
<i>With you.</i>


01:04:07.144 --> 01:04:10.489
<i>I think you should</i>
<i>take my nose.</i>


01:04:12.041 --> 01:04:15.351
<i>Won't it be funny, Auntie P?</i>


01:04:16.696 --> 01:04:20.144
<i>Mmm. You should take my eyes.</i>


01:04:22.144 --> 01:04:23.972
<i>Are you sure?</i>


01:04:24.593 --> 01:04:25.868
<i>Really?</i>


01:04:27.455 --> 01:04:29.386
<i>No!</i>


01:04:29.765 --> 01:04:31.627
<i>No! No!</i>


01:04:31.731 --> 01:04:33.386
<i>No!</i>


01:04:42.731 --> 01:04:47.110
<i>What if you're wrong,</i>
<i>Auntie P?</i> <i>What will happen?</i>


01:04:47.800 --> 01:04:50.041
<i>I bet it's bad.</i>


01:04:51.455 --> 01:04:53.179
You're wrong.
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:04:55.903 --> 01:04:57.317
<i>Will it be over?</i>


01:04:58.627 --> 01:05:02.420
Something you loved.


01:05:04.455 --> 01:05:06.179
<i>Will it stop?</i>


01:05:07.075 --> 01:05:08.800
I'll always love you.


01:05:18.317 --> 01:05:20.662
[ECHOING]
<i>We will see.</i>


01:05:23.868 --> 01:05:25.903
[LINE DISCONNECTS]


01:05:40.524 --> 01:05:41.834
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:05:48.696 --> 01:05:50.937
[FOOTSTEPS THUMPING]


01:06:05.834 --> 01:06:08.006
LAINIE:
What are you doing, babe?


01:06:08.110 --> 01:06:12.662
Have you been here long?
'Cause, um, Mark thought he heard someone.


01:06:13.386 --> 01:06:14.627
Lainie.


01:06:16.627 --> 01:06:18.868
Are you okay?
I called you earlier.


01:06:18.937 --> 01:06:20.179
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:06:21.765 --> 01:06:23.282
Your hand.
[GASPS]


01:06:25.455 --> 01:06:27.248
Polly, what's going on?
Aly?


01:06:27.351 --> 01:06:29.800
Polly?
Are you okay?


01:06:31.627 --> 01:06:32.972
[ALY YELPS]


01:06:33.868 --> 01:06:35.386
Are you okay?
Mama!


01:06:35.489 --> 01:06:37.627
You're okay. You're okay.


01:06:37.765 --> 01:06:39.006
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.


01:06:39.110 --> 01:06:41.248
LAINIE: Everything
okay up there? It's okay.


01:06:41.317 --> 01:06:44.041
We're fine.
It's all right. Sorry.


01:06:44.144 --> 01:06:47.455
What's happening, Auntie P?
I'm sorry. It's okay.


01:06:48.489 --> 01:06:52.317
I was being silly.
You are silly.


01:06:57.110 --> 01:06:58.903
Baby Doll...


01:07:03.351 --> 01:07:05.696
This little piggie...


01:07:06.317 --> 01:07:08.489
I wanna play, Auntie P.


01:07:08.627 --> 01:07:10.972
[POLLY GASPING]


01:07:13.041 --> 01:07:15.593
[ALY LAUGHING]


01:07:19.144 --> 01:07:20.386
Come here.


01:07:23.179 --> 01:07:25.593
I wanna show you something.


01:07:26.110 --> 01:07:27.386
[THUDDING]


01:07:30.282 --> 01:07:32.696
You should come see.


01:07:33.455 --> 01:07:34.868
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:07:36.006 --> 01:07:38.317
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:07:42.868 --> 01:07:44.662
I wanna play, Auntie P!


01:07:44.800 --> 01:07:46.937
[SHRIEKS, GASPS]


01:07:47.041 --> 01:07:48.075
I love you.


01:07:48.765 --> 01:07:49.765
[KNIFE STABS]


01:07:51.282 --> 01:07:52.696
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:08:05.937 --> 01:08:07.800
[SAND POURING]


01:08:09.834 --> 01:08:11.765
[UNEASY MUSIC]


01:08:12.765 --> 01:08:14.041
No.


01:08:14.110 --> 01:08:15.800
You're a liar.


01:08:15.903 --> 01:08:17.110
I did everything.


01:08:18.006 --> 01:08:19.006
I did everything.


01:08:19.075 --> 01:08:21.179
I gave you everything.


01:08:21.282 --> 01:08:25.420
Something I hate,
something I need, something I love, I did it.


01:08:25.524 --> 01:08:27.041
[SOBBING]
What more do you want?


01:08:32.662 --> 01:08:33.765
Where are you?


01:08:39.110 --> 01:08:40.800
[LINE BEEPING]


01:08:42.248 --> 01:08:43.558
Talk to me.


01:08:56.662 --> 01:08:58.593
Just stop. Please.


01:08:58.696 --> 01:09:00.731
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:09:01.593 --> 01:09:02.731
[SOBBING]


01:09:03.800 --> 01:09:05.110
Anything you want...


01:09:08.386 --> 01:09:09.627
Take it.


01:09:10.972 --> 01:09:12.282
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:09:17.455 --> 01:09:18.800
[SOBBING]


01:09:46.662 --> 01:09:49.041
[SCREAMING]


01:09:49.765 --> 01:09:51.489
[VOICE SCREAMING]


01:09:52.593 --> 01:09:54.455
No! No!


01:09:55.282 --> 01:09:57.317
No! No!


01:10:02.903 --> 01:10:03.972
[SOBBING]


01:10:05.041 --> 01:10:06.213
Let me go!


01:10:06.317 --> 01:10:08.041
Why won't you let me go?


01:10:12.937 --> 01:10:14.868
What is it? What is left?


01:10:14.972 --> 01:10:16.317
[SOBBING]


01:10:26.903 --> 01:10:27.972
She...


01:10:28.075 --> 01:10:29.386
[PANTING]


01:10:30.006 --> 01:10:32.903
She knocked on the door.


01:10:36.731 --> 01:10:39.110
She knew what she wanted.


01:10:42.937 --> 01:10:44.282
She gave it to me.


01:10:53.593 --> 01:10:54.800
She gave it to me.


01:10:58.420 --> 01:10:59.627
POLLY: Hello!


01:11:03.420 --> 01:11:05.144
Anyone home?


01:11:05.213 --> 01:11:06.972
[RINGS DOORBELL]


01:11:07.041 --> 01:11:08.110
Hello?


01:11:09.144 --> 01:11:10.179
[EXHALES]


01:11:12.765 --> 01:11:13.903
Somebody...


01:11:24.282 --> 01:11:25.524
Hello?


01:11:27.282 --> 01:11:28.593
Hello?


01:11:30.386 --> 01:11:32.041
Can somebody help me?


01:11:34.351 --> 01:11:35.558
Please.


01:11:41.489 --> 01:11:42.731
Somebody.


01:11:44.455 --> 01:11:46.386
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:11:53.075 --> 01:11:54.800
[DOORBELL RINGS]


01:12:00.455 --> 01:12:02.317
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]


01:12:25.110 --> 01:12:26.765
Thank you.


01:12:26.868 --> 01:12:28.937
Thank you.
I'm sorry it's so late.


01:12:30.075 --> 01:12:31.110
Are you okay?


01:12:32.627 --> 01:12:35.110
I was just
dropping something off.


01:12:35.248 --> 01:12:37.248
My sister's
just down the street.


01:12:37.351 --> 01:12:39.868
I was supposed
to bring her something. Um...


01:12:39.972 --> 01:12:44.524
I was supposed
to go there, but I... I forgot my key.


01:12:44.627 --> 01:12:46.282
I'm... I'm locked out.


01:12:46.386 --> 01:12:49.765
Sorry, I don't understand.
Do you... Do you need something?


01:12:49.903 --> 01:12:51.800
Um, I think I just need...


01:12:53.662 --> 01:12:57.455
I just...
I just need to come in. Just for a second.


01:12:57.593 --> 01:13:00.524
Uh, you know,
this is actually my parent's house.


01:13:00.627 --> 01:13:03.213
I'm just here visiting
for the holidays. So...


01:13:03.351 --> 01:13:07.593
They're... They're at
a work party right now. I... I can't...


01:13:09.524 --> 01:13:11.455
I just need
to call my sister.


01:13:12.662 --> 01:13:15.075
She just lives
right down the street.


01:13:16.006 --> 01:13:17.075
Right there.


01:13:22.144 --> 01:13:23.075
My name is Polly.


01:13:23.144 --> 01:13:25.006
[RUMBLING]


01:13:27.627 --> 01:13:29.213
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]


01:13:30.868 --> 01:13:33.006
[SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING]


01:13:43.317 --> 01:13:44.662
[SNIFFLES]


01:13:46.041 --> 01:13:47.179
Are you okay?


01:13:56.179 --> 01:13:57.075
No.


01:13:59.351 --> 01:14:00.455
No, I'm not.


01:14:06.317 --> 01:14:07.593
I'm really sorry.


01:14:09.351 --> 01:14:12.558
I'm sorry to bother you.
I just don't know what else to do.


01:14:12.627 --> 01:14:15.972
But if I am freaking you out,
you can call the police. I just...


01:14:16.489 --> 01:14:18.524
No, I'm just...


01:14:18.593 --> 01:14:20.041
You can tell me
what happened.


01:14:23.696 --> 01:14:24.800
I can't.


01:14:32.420 --> 01:14:34.696
Uh, I'll be right back.


01:14:50.420 --> 01:14:51.489
[CAT MEOWS]


01:15:03.110 --> 01:15:04.627
[SCREAMS]


01:15:30.662 --> 01:15:33.179
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]


01:15:51.593 --> 01:15:52.800
[EXHALES]


01:15:56.006 --> 01:15:58.558
My... My parents will be home
in a few minutes.


01:16:00.800 --> 01:16:05.524
Here. Drink this. I...
I made some tea tonight.


01:16:05.627 --> 01:16:07.213
It might help warm you up.


01:16:12.179 --> 01:16:13.075
What is that?


01:16:15.213 --> 01:16:16.524
Your name is Tara?


01:16:21.386 --> 01:16:23.455
How did you...
How did you know that?


01:16:24.282 --> 01:16:25.213
I just do.


01:16:31.282 --> 01:16:32.455
Thank you for the tea.


01:16:33.179 --> 01:16:34.455
[BREATHING SHAKILY]


01:16:35.903 --> 01:16:38.558
That was really,
really nice of you.


01:16:38.627 --> 01:16:41.420
Look, um, I think...
I think that you should maybe go...


01:16:41.558 --> 01:16:43.627
I just knew it.
I can't explain it.


01:16:46.731 --> 01:16:49.455
You'll understand. You will.


01:16:51.317 --> 01:16:52.455
Soon.


01:16:54.248 --> 01:16:55.524
What's going on?


01:17:00.765 --> 01:17:02.144
I don't want to be me.


01:17:05.937 --> 01:17:07.696
Is that a weird thing to say?


01:17:11.627 --> 01:17:12.903
It's true.


01:17:14.489 --> 01:17:17.110
Tired of feeling
like none of it matters.


01:17:18.317 --> 01:17:19.558
I want it to...


01:17:20.903 --> 01:17:22.006
so bad.


01:17:24.868 --> 01:17:26.800
I can change everything.


01:17:30.558 --> 01:17:31.800
But not me.


01:17:36.455 --> 01:17:38.800
I try so fucking hard.


01:17:42.110 --> 01:17:44.627
I bang my head
against the fucking wall.


01:17:47.248 --> 01:17:48.627
Every minute...


01:17:51.489 --> 01:17:52.868
every second.


01:17:53.972 --> 01:17:55.800
But nothing changes.


01:17:58.006 --> 01:17:59.524
It doesn't get better.


01:18:01.903 --> 01:18:03.627
I'm still right here.


01:18:08.420 --> 01:18:10.041
And it's all the same.


01:18:11.144 --> 01:18:12.731
What do you want?


01:18:12.868 --> 01:18:15.006
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]


01:18:17.972 --> 01:18:19.386
For it to stop.


01:18:27.075 --> 01:18:28.696
I'm going to start now.


01:18:30.489 --> 01:18:32.213
Your parents
aren't coming home.


01:18:32.317 --> 01:18:35.351
That wasn't true. Was it?


01:18:39.868 --> 01:18:41.489
I think that you...
I know. I know.


01:18:42.937 --> 01:18:44.213
But it doesn't matter.


01:18:47.455 --> 01:18:49.075
This belongs to you now.


01:18:53.144 --> 01:18:55.558
No, no. Get up.


01:18:55.696 --> 01:18:58.351
Get up. Look,
I was just trying to be nice. You really need to leave.


01:18:58.455 --> 01:19:00.386
I don't know
what your fucking deal is.


01:19:06.903 --> 01:19:08.524
You're going to die.


01:19:11.179 --> 01:19:13.110
[DOOR CREAKS, CLOSES]


01:19:14.144 --> 01:19:15.524
[DOOR OPENS]


01:19:31.144 --> 01:19:33.593
[SLOW SUSPENSEFUL
MUSIC PLAYING]


01:20:01.800 --> 01:20:03.075
I'm sorry.


01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:06.834
[EERIE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:20:24.524 --> 01:20:26.696
THE WOMAN: It wants me...
[GASPS]


01:20:27.420 --> 01:20:28.731
...to kill you.


01:20:33.455 --> 01:20:35.524
It won't let me go.


01:20:38.213 --> 01:20:40.524
You have to do things.


01:20:42.834 --> 01:20:45.317
It never, never stops.


01:20:46.972 --> 01:20:48.834
Get away from me.
[GASPS]


01:20:48.972 --> 01:20:50.834
It wants you!
No!


01:20:50.972 --> 01:20:53.593
Take it.
[BOTH GRUNT]


01:20:53.662 --> 01:20:54.317
No!


01:20:57.903 --> 01:20:58.972
[GASPS]


01:21:00.765 --> 01:21:02.351
[THE WOMAN GRUNTING]


01:21:02.489 --> 01:21:04.179
[CLOCK TOLLING]


01:21:06.903 --> 01:21:07.937
[GLASS BREAKING]


01:21:13.972 --> 01:21:15.593
[BOTH GRUNTING]


01:21:18.144 --> 01:21:19.386
[GRUNTS]


01:21:20.524 --> 01:21:22.800
[GASPING]
[THE WOMAN GROANING]


01:21:29.524 --> 01:21:31.006
[CHOKING]


01:21:49.696 --> 01:21:51.524
Stop.
Die.


01:21:51.627 --> 01:21:53.420
No! No!


01:21:54.662 --> 01:21:55.627
[THE WOMAN GROANS]


01:21:58.868 --> 01:22:00.765
[SCREAMING]


01:22:04.075 --> 01:22:05.420
Please.


01:22:06.420 --> 01:22:08.593
[GROANS]
[GRUNTS]


01:22:13.075 --> 01:22:14.972
[CHOKING, GROANING]


01:22:22.282 --> 01:22:23.489
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:22:26.800 --> 01:22:27.903
Why?


01:22:30.627 --> 01:22:31.834
Why? Tell me.


01:22:32.593 --> 01:22:33.696
[COUGHS]


01:22:33.765 --> 01:22:34.972
Why me?


01:22:36.110 --> 01:22:37.800
[BREATHING LABORIOUSLY]


01:22:41.213 --> 01:22:43.420
Someone knocked on my door.


01:22:49.110 --> 01:22:50.627
And I just opened it.


01:22:53.248 --> 01:22:55.075
No one ever knocks.


01:22:55.455 --> 01:22:56.662
Not anymore.


01:22:57.489 --> 01:23:01.041
Then someone finally...


01:23:02.627 --> 01:23:03.937
[GROANS]


01:23:05.524 --> 01:23:07.696
They could have
knocked anywhere.


01:23:09.696 --> 01:23:11.696
I could have
knocked anywhere.


01:23:14.075 --> 01:23:15.144
But I didn't.


01:23:17.868 --> 01:23:20.075
I think it chooses us...


01:23:22.213 --> 01:23:25.868
because we are broken.


01:23:28.868 --> 01:23:30.696
You were nice. I can tell.


01:23:34.834 --> 01:23:36.282
It doesn't matter.


01:23:38.627 --> 01:23:40.386
I tried so hard.


01:23:41.834 --> 01:23:44.593
The things we do
to ourselves.


01:23:44.662 --> 01:23:46.282
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:23:50.420 --> 01:23:52.179
It's never enough.


01:23:55.282 --> 01:23:58.662
Alas, everything I was...


01:24:00.386 --> 01:24:02.593
everything I could be...


01:24:08.558 --> 01:24:10.558
I was so afraid.


01:24:13.903 --> 01:24:15.937
The box needs that.


01:24:17.006 --> 01:24:19.731
The sand needs it.


01:24:24.937 --> 01:24:26.972
Don't be afraid of dying.


01:24:28.489 --> 01:24:32.006
Don't be afraid.


01:24:33.868 --> 01:24:35.420
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:24:41.351 --> 01:24:42.627
Thank you.


01:24:51.282 --> 01:24:53.627
[SOLEMN MUSIC PLAYING]


01:25:04.248 --> 01:25:05.627
[BREATH TREMBLES]


01:25:20.765 --> 01:25:23.006
POLLY: <i>Aly's five.</i>
<i>She's about to turn six.</i>


01:25:23.144 --> 01:25:26.386
We're having a birthday party
for her next week.


01:25:26.455 --> 01:25:29.144
That's nice.
It's a good age.


01:25:29.558 --> 01:25:31.075
I'm sure it is.


01:25:31.144 --> 01:25:32.662
So much more to do.


01:25:34.420 --> 01:25:35.834
I'm gonna start now.


01:25:37.006 --> 01:25:37.834
What?


01:25:39.248 --> 01:25:40.420
Ma'am, are you okay?


01:25:41.937 --> 01:25:45.765
If you wanna
give me that card, I can call you a car or...


01:25:45.834 --> 01:25:49.662
I can get my phone
and call you an Uber.


01:25:49.800 --> 01:25:51.627
THE WOMAN:
<i>This will be for you now.</i>


01:25:53.731 --> 01:25:55.903
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]


01:26:03.558 --> 01:26:06.593
MOTHER:
<i>You are going to die.</i>


01:26:07.248 --> 01:26:08.731
<i>Unless...</i>


01:26:08.868 --> 01:26:11.041
<i>Unless, unless,</i>
<i>unless, unless,</i> <i>unless, unless...</i>


01:26:11.144 --> 01:26:12.317
[GIRL SCREAMING]


01:26:12.420 --> 01:26:14.593
FATHER: <i>You don't want</i>
<i>that sand running out.</i>


01:26:14.696 --> 01:26:16.317
MOTHER:
<i>Unless, unless, unless...</i>


01:26:16.386 --> 01:26:18.903
<i>It's too hard, too scary.</i>


01:26:21.386 --> 01:26:23.524
[SOBBING]
I won't do it anymore.


01:26:23.627 --> 01:26:25.524
GIRL:
<i>Come and see.</i>


01:26:25.593 --> 01:26:27.627
MOTHER:
<i>Did you feel something then?</i>


01:26:27.731 --> 01:26:30.179
<i>You whore!</i>
<i>You said you will not desire.</i>


01:26:30.282 --> 01:26:31.282
<i>Help me!</i>


01:26:31.351 --> 01:26:33.696
<i>What do you love?</i>


01:26:33.834 --> 01:26:35.800
[GIRL TALKING DISTORTEDLY]


01:26:35.903 --> 01:26:37.834
<i>No! No! No!</i>


01:26:37.903 --> 01:26:41.386
FATHER: <i>You're wasting time,</i>
<i>Baby Doll.</i>[ECHOING]


01:26:42.972 --> 01:26:45.662
MOTHER:
<i>You are going to die.</i>


01:26:45.731 --> 01:26:48.386
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:26:49.248 --> 01:26:51.317
POLLY:
<i>I don't want to be me.</i>


01:26:51.420 --> 01:26:52.868
WOMAN IN MIRROR:
<i>You are dead!</i>


01:26:54.696 --> 01:26:57.213
MOTHER:
<i>Unless, unless, unless...</i>


01:26:57.351 --> 01:27:00.041
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]


01:27:00.144 --> 01:27:01.834
WOMAN IN MIRROR:
<i>You are dead!</i>


01:27:01.937 --> 01:27:02.937
[SCREAMS]


01:27:12.937 --> 01:27:14.868
[RUMBLING]


01:27:33.662 --> 01:27:36.455
[SLOW INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC
PLAYING]


01:28:16.558 --> 01:28:17.868
LAINIE: Polly?


01:28:55.006 --> 01:28:56.696
[BREATHING HEAVILY]


01:29:19.110 --> 01:29:20.179
POLLY: Aly!


01:29:20.282 --> 01:29:22.248
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:29:23.110 --> 01:29:24.937
[ALY LAUGHING]


01:29:27.868 --> 01:29:29.593
Oh, I love you.


01:29:30.868 --> 01:29:32.110
I love you.


01:29:34.420 --> 01:29:36.006
[ALY CHUCKLES]


01:29:39.903 --> 01:29:41.696
Mama's pissed at you.


01:29:42.903 --> 01:29:45.110
Mama's always pissed at me.
[CHUCKLES]


01:29:47.075 --> 01:29:48.558
What happened to you?


01:29:59.386 --> 01:30:00.903
What did you do?


01:30:06.041 --> 01:30:08.075
Tell Mom
I'll be right back, okay?


01:30:10.489 --> 01:30:11.662
Okay?


01:30:27.558 --> 01:30:28.903
[EXHALES]


01:30:40.627 --> 01:30:42.282
[DOORBELL RINGS]


01:30:44.972 --> 01:30:47.006
[EERIE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:30:57.144 --> 01:30:59.110
You can't play, okay?


01:31:00.455 --> 01:31:03.179
Give it to me.
What?


01:31:03.282 --> 01:31:05.558
Listen to me.
I should never have given it to you.


01:31:06.558 --> 01:31:07.627
Give me the box.


01:31:09.213 --> 01:31:11.662
What are you talking about?
Do it, now.


01:31:14.868 --> 01:31:16.110
Who are you?


01:31:17.179 --> 01:31:18.041
What?


01:31:19.627 --> 01:31:21.213
I... I think
you're confused.


01:31:21.317 --> 01:31:23.834
My parents and I,
we just got back.


01:31:23.937 --> 01:31:25.972
We were on vacation
for Christmas.


01:31:27.110 --> 01:31:28.696
You have the wrong house.


01:31:31.593 --> 01:31:32.972
Oh...


01:31:34.041 --> 01:31:35.041
I thought... I'm sorry.


01:31:35.179 --> 01:31:37.558
It's all right.
I'm sorry.


01:32:02.317 --> 01:32:03.696
I'll be in in a minute.


01:32:07.524 --> 01:32:08.903
LAINIE: Come on.


01:32:10.455 --> 01:32:12.420
[LAINIE SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY]
[SLOW INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]


01:32:12.558 --> 01:32:13.765
[EXHALES]


01:32:54.213 --> 01:32:56.248
[CELL PHONE VIBRATING]


01:33:04.627 --> 01:33:06.800
[CELL PHONE CONTINUES
VIBRATING]


01:33:06.903 --> 01:33:08.179
[BREATH TREMBLES]


01:33:24.593 --> 01:33:26.972
[CELL PHONE CONTINUES
VIBRATING]


01:33:31.248 --> 01:33:32.765
[BREATH TREMBLING]


01:33:50.455 --> 01:33:52.213
[VIBRATING STOPS]


01:34:16.627 --> 01:34:18.213
[CLOCK CHIMING]


01:34:46.903 --> 01:34:48.213
[CHIMING STOPS]


01:34:59.937 --> 01:35:01.868
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:35:43.937 --> 01:35:49.558
Something you... want.


01:35:52.937 --> 01:35:55.558
[CELL PHONE VIBRATING]
[LOUD RUMBLING]


01:35:58.110 --> 01:36:00.282
[CELL PHONE
CONTINUES VIBRATING]


01:36:04.696 --> 01:36:07.179
[SLOW OMINOUS MUSIC
PLAYING]

